{"id":"6209522b3fdd3e77","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-demuth-char.md","title":"Demuth 随机的余有限最终版本逃离","display":"thm-demuth-char — Demuth 随机的余有限最终版本逃离","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-demuth-char","aliases":["43-thm-demuth-char"],"display":"thm-demuth-char — Demuth 随机的余有限最终版本逃离","depends_on":["[[43-df-demuthrandom]]","[[43-df-demuthtest]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Denjoy, Demuth, and Density, Def.2.2, PDF p.8; https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-demuth-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-demuth-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-demuth-char — Demuth 随机的余有限最终版本逃离"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a71640fd59646f44\" href=\"?note=a71640fd59646f44\" title=\"43-df-demuthrandom\">43-df-demuthrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57783b109db5093f\" href=\"?note=57783b109db5093f\" title=\"43-df-demuthtest\">43-df-demuthtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Denjoy, Demuth, and Density, Def.2.2, PDF p.8; <a href=\"https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a71640fd59646f44\" href=\"?note=a71640fd59646f44\" title=\"43-df-demuthrandom\">43-df-demuthrandom</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DemuthTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{DemuthTest}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57783b109db5093f\" href=\"?note=57783b109db5093f\" title=\"43-df-demuthtest\">43-df-demuthtest</a>。下式的数组与函数取值域按量词显式给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\notin F_n(U,h))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\notin F_n(U,h))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原定理的“存在一个 n”同步改为标准余有限逃离，避免下游沿用旧 weak Demuth 命名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-demuthrandom","status":"resolved","id":"a71640fd59646f44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-demuthrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-demuthtest","status":"resolved","id":"57783b109db5093f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-demuthtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-demuthrandom","status":"resolved","id":"a71640fd59646f44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-demuthrandom]]；$\\mathrm{DemuthTest}$ 及 $F_n$ 见 [[43-df-demuthtest]]。下式的数组与函数取值域按量词显式给出。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-demuthtest","status":"resolved","id":"57783b109db5093f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-demuthrandom]]；$\\mathrm{DemuthTest}$ 及 $F_n$ 见 [[43-df-demuthtest]]。下式的数组与函数取值域按量词显式给出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DemuthTest}","display":false},{"tex":"F_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DemuthRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge m\\Rightarrow X\\notin F_n(U,h))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1319,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-515","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-demuth-char]] — Demuth 随机的余有限最终版本逃离"}],"outgoing":["a71640fd59646f44","57783b109db5093f"]}